OL,3,CICE faces criticism as agents to be
OL,4,Cgiven electric shock gloves
OL,6,FUS Immigration and Customs Enforcement
OL,7,F(ICE) plans to give officers gloves
OL,8,Fthat deliver painful electric shocks,
OL,9,Fin the latest tactic in cracking down
OL,10,Fon illegal immigration.
OL,12,FICE plans to spend between $10 million
OL,13,F(#7.4 million) and $20 million (#14.8
OL,14,Fmillion) to outfit officers and agents
OL,15,Fwith "conductive distraction and de-
OL,16,Fescalation devices," according to a
OL,17,Fnotice published earlier this week.
OL,26,@wD@FOUxD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
