OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786659489
OL,3,CICE faces criticism as agents to be
OL,4,Cgiven electric shock gloves
OL,6,FSeveral Democrats in Congress,
OL,7,Fincluding Pramila Jayapal, Maxwell
OL,8,FFrost and Delia Ramirez, said on
OL,9,Fsocial media that ICE did not need
OL,10,Fanother weapon.
OL,12,F"This won't make anyone safer and in
OL,13,Ffact just gives ICE another dangerous
OL,14,Ftool to target citizens and immigrants
OL,15,Falike," Jayapal wrote on X.
OL,26,@tD@AOUwD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
