OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786659489
OL,3,CICE faces criticism as agents to be
OL,4,Cgiven electric shock gloves
OL,6,FThe notice published in a DHS database
OL,7,Findicated the solicitation for a no-
OL,8,Fbid contract to purchase the gloves
OL,9,Fcould be released as early as Friday,
OL,10,Fand the contract would last through
OL,11,FMarch 31, 2027.
OL,13,FThe founder of Compliant Technologies
OL,14,FLLC, which manufactures the gloves,
OL,15,Fdeclined to comment.
